      "lang": "zh",
      "html": "<figure class=\"batch2\" id=\"visual-E12\" data-batch2=\"E12\" lang=\"zh\"><header><span>E12</span><h3>每条越界记录，只归入一格</h3></header><p class=\"\">途中越界以后，终点仍可能回到0。先按首次越界分片，每条记录就只被计算一次。</p><div class=\"v5-controls\" role=\"group\"><button type=\"button\" data-bin=\"all\" aria-pressed=\"true\">全部记录</button><button type=\"button\" data-bin=\"2\" aria-pressed=\"false\">首次第2步</button><button type=\"button\" data-bin=\"4\" aria-pressed=\"false\">首次第4步</button><button type=\"button\" data-bin=\"0\" aria-pressed=\"false\">未越界</button></div><div class=\"b2-pair\"><section class=\"b2-panel\"><h4>16份等概率的记录</h4><img class=\"ex-svg\" src=\"/assets/visuals/explanatory-early-v2/E12-zh-all.svg\" alt=\"Sixteen four-step records in disjoint crossing bins\" data-bin-scene></section><section class=\"b2-panel\"><h4>把同一前缀的未来放在一起</h4><img class=\"ex-svg\" src=\"/assets/visuals/explanatory-early-v2/E12-zh-tails.svg\" alt=\"Four possible futures after the prefix ++\" ></section></div><figcaption id=\"visual-E12-end\">有限精确模型：4次独立公平±1增量，S₀=0，阈值u=2。16条记录等概率；首次越界第2步、第4步及不越界分别8、4、4条。每条记录归属唯一一格，深色标出截至首次越界的信息。给定前缀++，四种未来各1/4，S₄²依次16、4、4、0，均值6≥S₂²=4；不是每条路径上S₄²≥S₂²。一般证明用Aₖ与未来独立、未来均值0消去交叉项，再把互斥事件求和；图不借用可选停止。</figcaption><nav><a href=\"/assets/visuals/explanatory-early-v2/E12.zh.svg\">完整静态SVG</a><a href=\"/print/E12.zh.html\">打印页</a></nav></figure>",
      "condition": "有限精确模型：4次独立公平±1增量，S₀=0，阈值u=2。16条记录等概率；首次越界第2步、第4步及不越界分别8、4、4条。每条记录归属唯一一格，深色标出截至首次越界的信息。给定前缀++，四种未来各1/4，S₄²依次16、4、4、0，均值6≥S₂²=4；不是每条路径上S₄²≥S₂²。一般证明用Aₖ与未来独立、未来均值0消去交叉项，再把互斥事件求和；图不借用可选停止。",
      "status": "author visual review pending",
      "kind": "new explanation"
    },
    {
      "id": "E12",
      "chapter": 12,
      "slug": "12-infinite-sums",
      "section": "12.2",
      "title": "Each crossing record belongs to one bin",
      "lang": "en",
      "html": "<figure class=\"batch2\" id=\"visual-E12\" data-batch2=\"E12\" lang=\"en\"><header><span>E12</span><h3>Each crossing record belongs to one bin</h3></header><p class=\"\">A record may cross and still finish at 0. Sorting by its first crossing counts it only once.</p><div class=\"v5-controls\" role=\"group\"><button type=\"button\" data-bin=\"all\" aria-pressed=\"true\">All records</button><button type=\"button\" data-bin=\"2\" aria-pressed=\"false\">First at step 2</button><button type=\"button\" data-bin=\"4\" aria-pressed=\"false\">First at step 4</button><button type=\"button\" data-bin=\"0\" aria-pressed=\"false\">No crossing</button></div><div class=\"b2-pair\"><section class=\"b2-panel\"><h4>16 equally likely records</h4><img class=\"ex-svg\" src=\"/assets/visuals/explanatory-early-v2/E12-en-all.svg\" alt=\"Sixteen four-step records in disjoint crossing bins\" data-bin-scene></section><section class=\"b2-panel\"><h4>Average the futures of one prefix</h4><img class=\"ex-svg\" src=\"/assets/visuals/explanatory-early-v2/E12-en-tails.svg\" alt=\"Four possible futures after the prefix ++\" ></section></div><figcaption id=\"visual-E12-end\">Exact finite model: four independent fair ±1 increments, S0=0, threshold u=2. The 16 equiprobable records split into 8 first crossing at step 2, 4 at step 4, and 4 never crossing. Dark signs mark information through the first crossing. Given ++, the four equiprobable futures give S4²=16,4,4,0, with mean 6≥S2²=4. This is not a pathwise inequality. The general proof cancels the cross term using an independent centered future and sums disjoint events; no optional stopping is used.</figcaption><nav><a href=\"/assets/visuals/explanatory-early-v2/E12.en.svg\">Complete static SVG</a><a href=\"/print/E12.en.html\">Print view</a></nav></figure>",
      "condition": "Exact finite model: four independent fair ±1 increments, S0=0, threshold u=2. The 16 equiprobable records split into 8 first crossing at step 2, 4 at step 4, and 4 never crossing. Dark signs mark information through the first crossing. Given ++, the four equiprobable futures give S4²=16,4,4,0, with mean 6≥S2²=4. This is not a pathwise inequality. The general proof cancels the cross term using an independent centered future and sums disjoint events; no optional stopping is used.",
      "status": "author visual review pending",
      "kind": "new explanation"
    },
