      "id": "E13",
      "chapter": 13,
      "slug": "13-rare-events",
      "section": "13.14",
      "title": "空格不是少了一点概率",
      "lang": "zh",
      "html": "<figure class=\"batch2\" id=\"visual-E13\" data-batch2=\"E13\" lang=\"zh\"><header><span>E13</span><h3>空格不是少了一点概率</h3></header><p class=\"\">±1走n步，只能落在与n同奇偶的位置。Gaussian密度给出的不是这些点的概率；还要乘真正的格宽。</p><div class=\"v5-controls\" role=\"group\"><button type=\"button\" data-lattice-n=\"4\" aria-pressed=\"true\">n=4</button><button type=\"button\" data-lattice-n=\"5\" aria-pressed=\"false\">n=5</button><button type=\"button\" data-lattice-n=\"6\" aria-pressed=\"false\">n=6</button></div><div class=\"b2-pair\"><section class=\"b2-panel\"><h4>精确离散质量</h4><img class=\"ex-svg\" src=\"/assets/visuals/explanatory-early-v2/E13-zh-4.svg\" alt=\"Parity lattice with exact binomial masses\" data-lattice-scene></section><section class=\"b2-panel\"><h4>密度 × 标准化格宽</h4><img class=\"ex-svg\" src=\"/assets/visuals/explanatory-early-v2/E13-zh-4-w2.svg\" alt=\"Local-density rectangle with the selected lattice width\" data-cell-scene></section></div><div class=\"v5-controls\" role=\"group\"><button type=\"button\" data-cell-width=\"2\" aria-pressed=\"true\">实际格宽2</button><button type=\"button\" data-cell-width=\"1\" aria-pressed=\"false\">误用格宽1</button></div><figcaption id=\"visual-E13-end\">Xⱼ独立公平取±1，均值0、方差1、最大跨度h=2，a=−1。Sₙ支撑在−n+2ℤ；圆的面积按精确二项概率缩放，圆中为分子，分母2ⁿ。下排相邻允许格子的宽度为2。右图在k=n mod 2处，展示φ(k/√n)乘h/√n的矩形，坐标已标准化；有限n时只是局部近似，并非精确等式。h=1会少一半，奇偶不允许位置的概率严格为0。切换n展示格子的平移，不宣称只用三帧证明局部CLT；一般有限方差一致误差见正文。</figcaption><nav><a href=\"/assets/visuals/explanatory-early-v2/E13.zh.svg\">完整静态SVG</a><a href=\"/print/E13.zh.html\">打印页</a></nav></figure>",
      "condition": "Xⱼ独立公平取±1，均值0、方差1、最大跨度h=2，a=−1。Sₙ支撑在−n+2ℤ；圆的面积按精确二项概率缩放，圆中为分子，分母2ⁿ。下排相邻允许格子的宽度为2。右图在k=n mod 2处，展示φ(k/√n)乘h/√n的矩形，坐标已标准化；有限n时只是局部近似，并非精确等式。h=1会少一半，奇偶不允许位置的概率严格为0。切换n展示格子的平移，不宣称只用三帧证明局部CLT；一般有限方差一致误差见正文。",
      "status": "author visual review pending",
      "kind": "new explanation"
